  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 902.04 Bankfull flow",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 902.04 “Bankfull flow” means the volume of flow in a watercourse at which water begins to overflow one or both banks.\n\nSource. #12809, eff 12-15-19",
